project-video is an original project-video workflow developed with human
feedback and comparisons with Brag (https://github.com/latent-spaces/brag).
Brag and Hyperframes are external projects, not bundled dependencies. No
upstream engine, music, sound effects, font binaries or private project material
is distributed in this package. A generated video's assets retain their own
licenses and audience; this package's MIT license does not relicense them.
